# /brag working files. The deliverables (brag.mp4, poster, plan, share copy)
# and the composition source are kept; everything below is either
# re-installable, re-derivable, or third-party media we should not
# redistribute raw.
brag-output/composition/node_modules/
brag-output/composition/renders/
brag-output/composition/snapshots/
brag-output/composition/vendor/
brag-output/composition/package-lock.json
# Bundled with the /brag skill under its own terms (music: ende.app,
# SFX: Kenney). Licensed for use *in* the video, which is where it is —
# encoded into brag.mp4 — not for redistribution as source files.
brag-output/composition/assets/audio/
# Copies of frontend/public/fonts — one source of truth for the faces.
brag-output/composition/assets/fonts/
# Site capture scratch; re-runnable with `hyperframes capture`.
brag-output/capture/
